---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Field guide"
  description="Install and explore the current Veasel Code foundation."
>
  <section class="doc-page page-grid">
    <p class="eyebrow">FIELD GUIDE / 01</p>
    <h1>
      Start with the
      <br />
      <em>foundation.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Veasel is in active early development. Today you can run the V API, create
      persistent sessions, inspect capabilities, and follow a replayable event
      stream.
    </p>
    <div class="doc-panel">
      <h2>Run it from source</h2>
      <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/veasel-labs/veasel
cd veasel
v run . serve</code></pre>
      <p>
        Requires V 0.5.2 or newer and SQLite development files. The server
        listens on <code>127.0.0.1:4097</code> by default.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-panel">
      <h2>Try the terminal client</h2>
      <pre><code>v run . tui</code></pre>
      <p>
        The current OpenTUI client lists sessions and connects only to an
        unauthenticated loopback API. Bun is required for this command.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="callout">
      <strong>Current boundary</strong> Model-provider calls, repository edits,
      and shell tools are not available yet. Follow the implementation plan in
      the source repository for verified progress.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}docs/architecture/`}>
      Next: architecture notes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
